[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4161880545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4161880545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4161880545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74EUHh","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T11:15:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T11:15:57Z","body":"Sorry about that, thought the formatter ran on save but it evidently didn't","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4161880545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169101747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4169101747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4169101747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74f3Gz","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T10:29:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T11:01:47Z","body":"Okay, I reworked the fix.\r\nI noticed several things:\r\n- We change the value on the `SpinBox frame` and that calls back `_seek_value_changed`. I turned this around as it felt very backwards.\r\n- `_seek_value_changed` is now called `_set_seek_value` and it's called directly. No more `frame->set_value`\r\n- `_set_seek_value` takes care of updating `frame` without emitting a signal\r\n- The value is still read back from `frame` as I've noticed it's used for clamping min and max values and as source of truth. This behavior is preserved.\r\n- This frees up the `value_changed` signal of `frame` for direct user input only\r\n- Now, the signal is used to detect the user input and set the seek value correctly in `_frame_value_changed`\r\n\r\nThis also removed a very twisted call at the end of `_animation_key_editor_seek`, where originally, `frame` was updated but `_seek_value_changed` was supressed with the `updating` flag, just to then call `_seek_value_changed` with correct parameters. This is just a single call with correct parameters, now.\r\n\r\nI verified that the `value_changed` signal of `frame` is not used anywhere else in the codebase.\r\nI further verified that `_seek_value_changed` (now `_set_seek_value`) is also not used anywhere else in the codebase (to rule out any regressions or side effects this change could have caused).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169101747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169495191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4169495191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4169495191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74hXKX","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T11:44:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T11:44:50Z","body":"In the following two cases, the button step reverts to 0.001, which seems inconsistent and unstable. \r\n\r\n- The first button click immediately after pausing an animation\r\n- When the snapping cursor is enabled\r\n\r\n<img width=\"284\" height=\"79\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db395214-7a68-4405-bb04-b7b3fce65775\" />\r\n\r\nOther than that, I think it behaves as expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169495191/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179524571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4179524571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4179524571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75Hnvb","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T18:00:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T18:00:28Z","body":"Hello there. The mentioned issues are fixed. And I tested the function for way longer animation runtimes as well since this was a float precision issue. (It would stop working beyond 2048 seconds). It should now have plenty of range. I tested up to 10k seconds which is a bit less than 3 hours. I don't think more range is needed as the interface begins to give up for such long tracks anyways.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179524571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4183509835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4183509835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4183509835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75W0tL","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T13:34:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T13:35:42Z","body":"> When the snapping cursor is enabled\r\n\r\nThis case hasn't been fixed. I think you can easily reproduce the issue by scrolling with the mouse wheel while input state in the current time spin box.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca7bb502-2547-48bf-8b6e-18d2fc75b496\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4183509835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187031832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4187031832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4187031832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75kQkY","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T12:16:51Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T12:16:51Z","body":"@TokageItLab Can you tell me what CPU you're using and which platform/build?\r\nThis does not just simply happen for me with mouse wheel inputs. However I did find some other edge cases. Your mouse polling rate (mouse model should be enough)  is also of interest here.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187031832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4194822250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4194822250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4194822250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76B-hq","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T20:31:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T23:03:04Z","body":"@TokageItLab\r\n\r\nI changed when snapping is applied as it made no sense to apply it all the time. The spin box only snaps when you also enabled snapping or use [ctrl] to en-/disable it. It is now fully consistent with the snapping behavior of the timeline itself. I also tested quarter frame steps (auto snapping enabled + [shift])\r\n\r\nI think this is a much more sensible solution, now.\r\n\r\nThis eliminated the need to detect a small delta to catch button inputs and all those weird bugs should be gone.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4194822250/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4237299167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118031#issuecomment-4237299167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118031","id":4237299167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78kA3f","user":{"login":"Alzurana","id":7355313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTUzMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana","html_url":"https://github.com/Alzurana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alzurana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-13T14:48:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T14:48:47Z","body":"Just rebased for @ydeltastar to take a look","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments